<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00456">
	<title>Stopping vehicle and ending brake control</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e03154">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e03155">
								<image href="images/N_SP3i25_C00_012_IR.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<ol outputclass="callout" id="e03156">
								<li>
									<p><uicontrol>Drive carefully</uicontrol></p>
								</li>
							</ol>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>If Emergency Braking stops your vehicle, a warning message appears on the instrument cluster.</p>
		<p>For safety purposes, you should immediately engage the brake pedal and check the vehicle’s surroundings.</p>
		<p>Brake control ends approximately 2 seconds after Emergency Braking stops your vehicle.</p>
		<note type="tip">
			<p>Press the hazard lights button to turn <term translate="no">OFF</term> the warning sound during collision warning and emergency braking.</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
